        rdf:object "Create a scenario coverage report, based on historical user questions and/or historical Gremlin usage analysis, showing how much historical traffic can be handled by AI Search versus Graph; identify scenarios where AI Search is enough, where Graph is required, and candidates for dedicated tools versus fallback logic, to enable evidence-based retrieval optimization decisions." ;
