        rdf:object "Dedicated tool accepting a disease or ICD-10 input and returning matching drugs, using a crafted Graph query rather than LLM-generated Gremlin; intent detection routes 'drug for disease' questions to this tool. A further dedicated tool is planned for the 'drug contraindicated for condition' scenario based on structured retrieval." ;
