        rdf:object "Identify possibilities of using modern technologies including AI, prioritise them, specify the most important functions and implement them in the service; candidate features include Asystent Leków (drug interactions, pre-prescription questions, accompanying tests, key patient information, drug availability and alternatives, reimbursement information, dosing with calculator redirection and dialog interface) and Historia rozmów (extraction of diseases and drugs, notifications about new therapies and reimbursement changes)." ;
