        rdf:object "The fallback reasoning node returns a strict structured format instead of free-form prose, avoiding unnecessary explanatory text when only structured query-planning data is required; configured through prompting, output schema, token limits, or a combination; the new format is evaluated against examples where longer reasoning output correlated with poorer results." ;
