        rdf:object "Handle Gremlin execution failures intelligently: capture errors and pass them back to the component that can correct the query, distinguish syntax-style from missing-field-style failures, test the correction path on examples where the first generated query fails, and avoid blindly skipping to a generic fallback when actionable error information is available." ;
