        rdf:object "Investigate cases where random English or system-like fragments appear in final answers so user-facing responses stay clean and professional: collect examples, determine whether the cause is model behavior, prompt leakage, intermediate reasoning leakage, or platform behavior, add the issue to the evaluation dataset or regression checks, and propose a mitigation once the source is identified. A further backlog item is to evaluate Polish prompting for Polish medical retrieval scenarios." ;
