        rdf:object "End users want the assistant to return all relevant articles and videos above the configured relevance/similarity threshold rather than being artificially limited to the first 10 results; a solution architect wants ICD-10 vs ATC retrieval choice validated so similar questions do not yield inconsistent or confusing results." ;
