        rdf:object "During indexing, Vimeo videos without transcripts are not indexed as searchable documents; missing-transcript cases are logged, ingestion continues with remaining videos, and the video can be indexed in a subsequent run once a transcript becomes available, supporting gradual upload/transcription availability; logic covered by tests for missing and available transcript cases." ;
