        rdf:object "Intent/entity detection distinguishes dose from dosage questions; the routing layer retrieves the correct field depending on detected intent; the known English dose/dosage ambiguity is explicitly addressed in prompts, routing rules, or field descriptions; the scenario is included in critical evaluation cases." ;
