        rdf:object "Engineering team wants to review and improve intent-detection quality so that user questions are routed to the correct calculator, retrieval path, or dedicated tool; acceptance criteria: known intent-detection mistakes collected and analyzed, routing errors involving calculator selection included in the review, scenario descriptions and examples used by the intent detector updated where needed, improved detector evaluated against historical failure cases." ;
