        rdf:object "Evaluate whether semantic search or ranking improves few-shot example retrieval so irrelevant examples are less likely to be selected for Gremlin-related prompting; review current vector-search-based retrieval, check cases where superficially similar questions return semantically wrong examples, and recommend whether semantic search/ranking should replace or augment the current approach. Make the fallback reasoning node return concise structured output instead of long prose to reduce context size, latency and downstream failure risk." ;
