        rdf:object "Identify cases where entity cleanup fails because a model response is blocked by content filtering; evaluate whether a model or deployment with lower content filtering is available for the medical/pharmaceutical use case; if not, define a workaround strategy for problematic pharmaceutical entities that preserves the ability to answer follow-up questions where possible; keep only currently relevant entities in conversation state so previous drugs or conditions do not incorrectly influence later questions." ;
        rdf:predicate fact:solution-direction ;
        rdf:subject entity:pharma-assistant ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/text-ontology/document/doc-28b154549e870b67> .

