        rdf:object "Gremlin execution errors are captured and passed back to the component that can correct the query; the system distinguishes syntax-style failures from missing-field-style failures where possible; the correction path is tested against examples where the first generated query fails; the fallback strategy does not blindly skip to a generic fallback when actionable error information is available." ;
