        rdf:object "Build a combined tool supporting the query pattern 'drug for X that cannot/should not be used with Y', using ICD-10 mapping where relevant and returning a filtered list rather than requiring the LLM to reason over two independent result sets; analyze historical user questions and classify them into qualitative vs quantitative retrieval scenarios." ;
