        rdf:object "Provide human-readable descriptions of important fields (including status/flag-style fields) to the answer-generation step, accompany returned data with context explaining field meanings, avoid presenting raw technical field values as user-facing medical explanations, and distinguish dose vs dosage questions so doctors get the correct type of information about drug strength or administration instructions." ;
