        rdf:object "Wirtualny Asystent Polpharmy (WAP): AI-powered conversational assistant for Polish-language medical interactions, giving access to product information, active substances, contraindications, adverse reactions, interactions, reimbursement, medical articles, clinical calculators and eDetailing materials; uses Graph RAG with hybrid retrieval and a Polish medical NLP layer." ;
