        rdf:object "Wirtualny Asystent Polpharmy (WAP): AI-powered conversational platform supporting healthcare professionals (physicians, pharmacists) with faster access to verified, source-grounded information about medicines, therapeutic areas, medical content, calculators, reimbursement and eDetailing materials; a digital medical and commercial engagement layer for Polpharma embedded in the PolpharmaDlaCiebie.pl ecosystem; not a diagnostic system." ;
